  "bodyHash": "NHOQ/wFFXUE=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1354/230/casually-swimming.gif\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">這個模組在遊戲中加入了具攻擊性的水下生物——公牛鯊。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">牠們會生成在溫暖海洋、微暖海洋和河流中，</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">並且相當稀有，但若牠們出現，你將會更加珍惜自己的生命。</span></p><p><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">這些獵手在滿足巨大食慾之前不會放過目標，每次咬下都會留下血泊。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">牠們具有一條隱藏的飢餓值。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">會隨著時間逐漸感到飢餓。（5分鐘後完全進入飢餓狀態）</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">飢餓值可透過手動餵食恢復，</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">當牠在水中吃到掉落的肉或魚類物品時，</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">或當牠咬中目標時，都能恢復30秒的飢餓值。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">對牠造成傷害會使飢餓值歸零，並觸發暴走模式！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">生成時，初始飢餓值會在0到5分鐘之間隨機決定，</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">因此你可能會遇到極度飢餓的個體。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">具有三種行為模式！</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">這會決定牠對鎖定獵物的行動方式。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">好奇：（緩慢速度，飢餓值高於3分鐘時）</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">偶爾會咬附近目標一口，恢復30秒飢餓值，但不會持續攻擊。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">飢餓：（正常速度，飢餓值降至3分鐘時）</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">搜尋附近最小的目標，持續撕咬直到飢餓值恢復。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">攻擊：（快速速度，飢餓值降至1分鐘時）</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">極度飢餓或遭受攻擊時，會尋找獵物並持續攻擊所有目標，透過撕咬和衝撞來滿足食慾。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">當獵物離開水面到陸地上時，牠們會停止攻擊。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">在搜尋獵物時，牠們優先選擇掉落物而非生物目標，所以若牠尚未鎖定你，仍有機會逃脫！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">對了，當牠咬中目標時，還會恢復少量生命值。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">在Forge中，你可以透過編輯data資料夾下的生物群系標籤和修飾器JSON檔案（或透過資源包）來調整這些與其他生成設定；在Fabric中則有專用設定檔。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">目前模組支援版本：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Forge&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Fabric&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9&nbsp;| 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Neoforge 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1354/228/bullshark-logo-gif.gif\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><strong>若您需要其他版本的模組，或在CurseForge上遇到任何錯誤，請私訊我。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\"><strong>在X（Twitter）上追蹤我</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此模組需安裝AquariusLibs</strong></a></span></p>",
